# self_edit_manager.py's real per-call-unique staging filename (Finding 22
# Batch 4: "staging files are now per-call-unique... f'self_edit_candidate_
# {uuid.uuid4().hex}.py'") never matched staging/_*.py above (no leading
# underscore) — 25+ of these were accumulating as untracked cruft instead
# of being gitignored as intended (found 2026-07-13). Deliberately does
# NOT match staging/self_edit_candidate.py itself (no trailing underscore
# before the extension) — that's STAGING_FILE, a real tracked fixture.
